Source: konaro-tools
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Konaro OS Project <maintainers@konaro.invalid>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: konaro-common
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-pyqt6, python3-pyqt6.qtquick, python3-pyqt6.qtqml,
         qml6-module-qtquick, qml6-module-qtquick-controls, qml6-module-qtquick-layouts,
         qml6-module-qtquick-templates, qml6-module-qtquick-window, qml6-module-qtqml-workerscript,
         qml6-module-org-kde-kirigami, fonts-inter, python3-gi,
         gir1.2-packagekitglib-1.0, packagekit, flatpak,
         libkf6config-bin, kde-cli-tools, qdbus-qt6
Description: Konaro OS - shared library for the graphical system tools
 Python library and QML design system shared by the Konaro Store, Updates,
 Drivers and Welcome tools. Package operations go through PackageKit (Debian packages, with
 polkit authorization) and Flatpak (Flathub). Also configures Flathub.

Package: konaro-store
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, konaro-common (= ${source:Version})
Description: Konaro OS - app store
 Curated catalog of apps and games with categories, search, details
 (source, format and Flatpak permissions), install and removal.

Package: konaro-updater
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, konaro-common (= ${source:Version}), libnotify-bin
Description: Konaro OS - update notifier and installer
 Shows available updates grouped as security, system, Konaro and Flatpak,
 and installs them only when the user asks. A user systemd timer checks
 periodically and shows a notification.

Package: konaro-drivers
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, konaro-common (= ${source:Version}), pciutils, isenkram-cli
Recommends: nvidia-detect
Description: Konaro OS - driver manager
 Detects hardware and suggests drivers and firmware (NVIDIA proprietary
 driver, packages suggested by isenkram), asking permission before
 installing.

Package: konaro-welcome
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, konaro-common (= ${source:Version}), network-manager
Recommends: konaro-store, konaro-updater, konaro-drivers, plasma-widgets-addons
Description: Konaro OS - first-run welcome
 Guided first login: language, light/dark appearance, network, privacy,
 updates, drivers, games and tips. In the live session it also offers
 to install the system.

Package: konaro-gaming
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, wine, wine64, fonts-wine, gamemode,
         mangohud, mesa-vulkan-drivers, vulkan-tools, steam-devices
Recommends: winetricks, lutris
Description: Konaro OS - games and Windows apps
 Wine (double-click .exe files), Winetricks, GameMode, MangoHud, Vulkan
 drivers, Steam controller rules and Lutris. The live image also enables
 32-bit (i386) support for Wine, Steam and Proton.
